  "name": "Chocolate Ricotta Baklava with Spiced Nuts",
  "subtitle": "Crisp filo layered with citrus ricotta, spiced nuts, and dark chocolate",
  "description": "A rich layered baklava combining buttery filo, citrus-scented ricotta, spiced nuts, pistachios, and dark chocolate beneath a lemon syrup.",
